flowchart LR
    Q[Question] --> FS[First-pass hybrid retrieval<br/>BM25 + dense]
    FS --> SEEDS[Seed papers]

    SEEDS --> SUB[1. Subgraph by Cypher<br/>weighted_subgraph<br/>similar + topic + author]
    SUB --> EXP[2. Expand to chunks<br/>pinned dense over subgraph papers]
    FS --> EXP
    EXP --> SAFE{Provenance filter<br/>source pinning + injection scrub}
    SAFE --> BLEND[3. Blend + rerank<br/>semantic-MMR + graph prior]
    BLEND --> ANS[4. Answer<br/>grounded, with citations and page ranges]
    ANS --> OUT[Cited answer]

    subgraph STORES[Stores]
        MONGO[(MongoDB<br/>chunks + provenance)]
        QDRANT[(Qdrant<br/>bge vectors)]
        NEO[(Neo4j<br/>CITES + SIMILAR_TO)]
    end
    QDRANT -.-> FS
    QDRANT -.-> EXP
    NEO -.-> SUB
    MONGO -.-> ANS

    EVAL[Evaluation<br/>faithfulness · answer-rel · recall · p95]
    ANS -.-> EVAL
